  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">(39 fotos) El CD Castell&oacute;n ha ganado la segunda edici&oacute;n del toreno Castell&oacute;n Base de f&uacute;tbol alev&iacute;n, disputado en los campos municipales de l&#39;Ol&iacute;mpic y La Serratella en Onda, al imponerse en la final a Primer Toque CF 4-3.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/CDondaCastellonBase.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Han participado el CD Onda y</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/RacingOndaCastellonBase.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">el Racing Onda.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torneigcastellobase/img_7633.jpg\" alt=\"img_7633\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torneigcastellobase/img_7634.jpg\" alt=\"img_7634\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torneigcastellobase/img_7635.jpg\" alt=\"img_7635\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torneigcastellobase/img_7638.jpg\" alt=\"img_7638\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torneigcastellobase/img_7639.jpg\" alt=\"img_7639\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torneigcastellobase/img_7643.jpg\" alt=\"img_7643\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25d